From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:15:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] feat(selection): streamer-reaction detection with
 game-event correlation

Voice (vocal/pitch/laugh, harmonic-gated so explosions do not count) and
facecam activity agree into reaction episodes; each is matched to the game
event that preceded it. Facecam region is masked out of game evidence.
Reaction hints also feed the transcript ranker (REACTION_SIGNALS=0 opts out).
Synthetic matrix only plus real-speech false-positive control; no real
streamer VOD validation yet.
